# Verdant Solar
# -------------
# Solar statistics fetcher & visualiser for booking.verdantsolar.my
#
# Usage:
#   python verdant_solar_fetch.py          # fetch data (no auth required)
#   python verdant_solar_viz.py            # generate charts
#
# Configuration:
#   verdant_config.yaml  — station ID, dates, paths, chart style
#   .env                 — secrets / API keys (optional)
#   CLI arguments        — --station, --start, --end etc. override both
#
# Requirements:
#   pip install requests matplotlib pandas python-dotenv pyyaml

# ── Files to exclude from Git ──────────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/.pyc
.env
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Secrets — never commit
**/*.secret
**/credentials.json
!verdant_config.yaml
!.env.example
